{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:50 2026-09-24 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/189f42a42510fa5aa901fba6d5a6ff18/2026-09/179024033658534.jpg\"/>\n<p>旺角揭發虐待動物案件。今日（24日）中午12時09分，警方接獲廣東道1036號一唐樓的居民報案，指大廈梯間傳出陣陣惡臭異味。人員到場發現臭味來自一單位，但拍門無人應，於是破門入屋，赫然發現單位內有多隻龜，其中2隻已死去，10隻仍然生還；另外還有一具懷疑屬於貓的動物屍體。</p>\n<img alt=\"一批龜隻仍然生還。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7f462e3cfc0a67b588a6c078fa711ad8/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/957fa7048ec676ac88cfaa1366f53b26/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/897e82101de2a902a05963585a1d34aa/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_16_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"箱內的水已發黑並傳出異味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f070f520ddd95768b91adb639b02e153/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_16_24.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屋內有多隻龜，其中2隻死去，10隻生還。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/be5bb7b2f5b3b56bae026233ed4374e5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_16_23_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/10604234d67ac9190caa2f531825e164/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_16_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a4763386c49bcb3ac5adb211f81c62dc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_16_16.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員檢獲多隻龜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/31baebba6cfad54f515e4196f08e1bd9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_16_14.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/211ba5d80182e8c08fd8587ee46550bc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_16_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方封鎖現場調查。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a44329db19620e6d019042d8872aac6f/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6afbd9d5a845a10a2b785732d834f351/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場是廣東道1036號唐樓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8e024def2638d054a93f0845f302ad60/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_38_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8cfdace62e49d348d1a63339ca845ff7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協派員到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ee53d2b029d860bc1e2f3bec26fa13b2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_32_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/afaba6d5bfa01443562268f815d121da/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_32.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/dc5265ad8802e63cf034b7fdce020195/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協人員上樓檢走動物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/44ec415c1d480a0d2c88cbe8f9f59e73/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_22_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ce1e6fd4ac3886764534f13a74096686/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_14_19_22.jpeg\"/>\n<p>現場所見，警員在涉事的單位搬出多個裝有龜隻的膠箱，箱內的水已發黑並傳出異味。據鄰居表示，過往已多次嗅到涉事單位傳出惡臭，該單位由一名中年女子獨居。據悉該名女子自4個月前已無再交租，留下的電話號碼亦未有用戶登記，警方其後通知愛護動物協會派員協助，檢走相關動物處理；經初步調查後，將案件列作「殘酷對待動物」，正追查涉案住戶下落。</p>\n<img alt=\"愛協人員在單位內帶走部份生還龜隻。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a074eff60c0c1067649dfd8fe61bd06e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_16_20_17_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協人員在單位內帶走部份生還龜隻。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1d5639c09ed72db269a38b01054bd80a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_16_20_20_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"人員在單位內檢走至少2隻死龜及一具貓屍。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/75eaffbfe3b9fca9a474df70c112ecbf/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_16_20_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"人員在單位內檢走至少2隻死龜及一具貓屍。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/0016f69895310128548f7f1739550adc/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_16_20_18_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協人員在單位帶走證物。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9bdbbb603e687b6862e76b808072fcb9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_16_20_16_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"愛協人員在單位內帶走部份生還龜隻。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/24d2f2258bd6d9600f591008fab81738/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_16_20_21.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T10:00:32.319287+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":25,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}